{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113185","id":3047325725,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc61ooAd","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113185","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113185.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113185.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113185","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113185/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113185/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113185/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c020a9f15f0485fe20d256779833fd608df5aec7","number":113185,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use nearest-neighbor scaling to align textures to the next block size for VRAM compression","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Supersedes #115307\r\nShould fix #113121\r\n\r\nChanges the texture compressors' padding algorithm to instead align the textures to the nearest block size using nearest-neighbor scaling. This corrects the mipmap count of compressed textures and fixes some edge cases that would otherwise occur with the previous approach.\r\n\r\n### Rationale:\r\nCurrently, Godot makes use of a very simple padding algorithm to align a texture's resolution to the necessary block size (commonly 4x4, but ASTC allows many more). While said algorithm is fairly fast and avoids smearing low-resolution images (unlike Lanczos or Bicubic), it also comes with several drawbacks:\r\n- smeared lines at the right and bottom parts of a texture: I was initially hoping this could've been avoided by setting the resolution of a block-compressed texture to the same value as the source texture's, but sadly this feature isn't supported by all rendering backends, especially WebGL.\r\n- Mipmap-related issues: Such as the one linked above,\r\n- Duplicate code: The same code appears in effectively each compressor module. I'm also fairly certain each instance contains minor bugs.\r\n\r\nWhile these problems could be fixed/improved, ultimately I've decided to simply switch to nearest-neighbor scaling, which is faster than the other algorithms and doesn't blur low-resolution images as much.\r\n\r\nTesting project: [compress-tester.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27087410/compress-tester.zip)\r\n\r\nThe testing project displays the last mipmap of an entirely white texture, which is the desired result. If the color changes during compression it means the last mipmap is incorrectly handled and filled with garbage data.\r\n\r\nComparison:\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|-------|\r\n| <img width=\"1164\" height=\"666\" alt=\"old\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a203ce7b-4578-4570-b59a-d60897f26c03\" /> | <img width=\"1164\" height=\"659\" alt=\"new\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87e34724-7544-4371-917a-d8a21199c310\" /> |\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","